
 Send Email
  -> This Project We can Learn Send Email To Any One, Using spring Boot And Java Mail Sender
  -> This is the Dependency We Need To Add In Our Project
            <dependency>
    			<groupId>org.springframework.boot</groupId>
    			<artifactId>spring-boot-starter-mail</artifactId>
    		</dependency>
  -> This is The Code For Sending Email To Any One
            @Autowired
            private JavaMailSender javaMailSender;

            public void sendEmail(String to, String subject, String body) {
                SimpleMailMessage mailMessage = new SimpleMailMessage();
                mailMessage.setTo(to);
                mailMessage.setSubject(subject);
                mailMessage.setText(body);
                javaMailSender.send(mailMessage);
            }

    -> This is The Code For Sending Email With Attachment To Any One
            @Autowired
            private JavaMailSender javaMailSender;

            public void sendEmailWithAttachment(String to, String subject, String body, String attachmentPath) {
                MimeMessage mimeMessage = javaMailSender.createMimeMessage();
                try {
                    MimeMessageHelper helper = new MimeMessageHelper(mimeMessage, true);
                    helper.setTo(to);
                    helper.setSubject(subject);
                    helper.setText(body);
                    FileSystemResource file = new FileSystemResource(new File(attachmentPath));
                    helper.addAttachment(file.getFilename(), file);
                    javaMailSender.send(mimeMessage);
                } catch (MessagingException e) {
                    e.printStackTrace();
                }
            }
    -> JavaMailSender is Used to Send Email To Any One, It is An Interface Provided By Spring Framework,
        It Provides Methods To Send Email To Any One, It Also Provides Methods To Send Email With Attachment To Any One,
        It Also Provides Methods To Send Email With HTML Content To Any One, It Also Provides Methods To Send Email With Inline Resources To Any One,
        It Also Provides Methods To Send Email With Multiple Recipients To Any One,
        It Also Provides Methods To Send Email With CC And BCC To Any One,
        It Also Provides Methods To Send Email With Priority To Any One,
        It Also Provides Methods To Send Email With Read Receipt To Any One,
        It Also Provides Methods To Send Email With Delivery Receipt To Any One,
        It Also Provides Methods To Send Email With Custom Headers To Any One,
        It Also Provides Methods To Send Email With Custom Properties To Any One,
        It Also Provides Methods To Send Email With Custom Authentication To Any One,
        It Also Provides Methods To Send Email With Custom Session To Any One,
        It Also Provides Methods To Send Email With Custom Transport Protocols To Any One,
        It Also Provides Methods To Send Email With Custom Mail Sender Implementation To Any One.
    -> JavaMailSender provide Methods are
            send(SimpleMailMessage simpleMessage)
            send(SimpleMailMessage... simpleMessages)
            send(MimeMessage mimeMessage)
            send(MimeMessage... mimeMessages)

    -> SimpleMailMessage is a Simple Mail Message Class Provided By Spring Framework,
       It is Used To Create A Simple Mail Message Object,
       It Provides Methods To Set The To, Subject, Text, From, ReplyTo, CC, BCC, Priority, Read Receipt, Delivery Receipt,
       Custom Headers, Custom Properties, Custom Authentication, Custom Session, Custom Transport Protocols, Custom Mail
       Sender Implementation Of The Email To Be Sent.
    -> MimeMessageHelper is a Mime Message Helper Class Provided By Spring Framework,
       It is Used To Create A Mime Message Object,
       It Provides Methods To Set The To, Subject, Text, From, ReplyTo, CC, BCC, Priority, Read Receipt, Delivery Receipt,
       Custom Headers, Custom Properties, Custom Authentication, Custom Session, Custom Transport Protocols, Custom Mail
       Sender Implementation Of The Email To Be Sent.
    -> SimpleMailMessage Provides Methods are
            setTo(String to)
            setSubject(String subject)
            setText(String text)
            setFrom(String from)
            setReplyTo(String replyTo)
            setCc(String cc)
            setBcc(String bcc)
            setPriority(int priority)
            setReadReceipt(boolean readReceipt)
            setDeliveryReceipt(boolean deliveryReceipt)
            addHeader(String name, String value)
            addProperty(String name, Object value)
    -> MimeMessageHelper Provides Methods are
            setTo(String to)
            setSubject(String subject)
            setText(String text)
            setFrom(String from)
            setReplyTo(String replyTo)
            setCc(String cc)
            setBcc(String bcc)
            setPriority(int priority)
            setReadReceipt(boolean readReceipt)
            setDeliveryReceipt(boolean deliveryReceipt)
            addHeader(String name, String value)
            addProperty(String name, Object value)
            addAttachment(String attachmentFilename, InputStreamSource inputStreamSource)
            addAttachment(String attachmentFilename, File file)
            addAttachment(String attachmentFilename, DataSource dataSource)
            addInline(String contentId, InputStreamSource inputStreamSource)
            
